<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 10.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 10.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		11.68 vs   4.05 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  17.69 vs   3.04 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 6.79 vs   2.36 profit</p>
<p> Sales		  141.37 vs 114.79</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.55 vs   40.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.01 vs   59.12</p>
<p> Operating profit    68.90 vs   72.50</p>
<p> Sales		1,403.26 vs1,119.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader is Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
